    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>扬州茶的故事，我觉得值得来说一说。所以就做了一期播客。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 扬州产茶的历史</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 绿杨春茶的来历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 春日星茶义卖介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 陆羽与李季卿的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> 天下第五泉的来历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> 扬州早茶的具体内容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 魁龙珠茶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 茶干</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 扬州评话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 春日星茶的采茶、炒茶、装茶介绍</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqVZDHe0_7EXpNmJsAD0mjk7X59I.png"><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiy24PU9Y501BRr1vlIZPAkJDn0A.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmh71XZlvrF-uX2C3XiZi1cc-Vl_.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqfYxzuPsHdjz1af0ilM1qvCSLXL.png"></figure><p><span>制作：呆羊</span></p>]]></description>
