  <item>
    <title>让扬州人无路可走，保姆级扬州游玩指南（拍照篇）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6629deffff598d65f21db507</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6629deffff598d65f21db507</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Apr 2024 04:41:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听正在皮脸，如果你来扬州，有时间可以听一听。内容都是关于拍照，实际也是节假日如何很悠闲，没有太多人打搅的旅游建议。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>诗画瘦西湖，人文古扬州。</span></strong><span>我脑抽了，当时说反了，哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 瘦西湖拍照推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsN8tgsnb5zRYx3LpFPjT-2Szuw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>友谊厅、藕香桥、疏峰馆、小金山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvax2YywB52DYKg2teymP9tIz6DY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 静香书屋、石壁流淙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlKctOoX37-q_yE5juOJ1WCuxwXs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>扬派盆景博物馆、罗城遗址</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQzWDSDNM6E3Nz_vRXUjpcCpO9X.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 大明寺、平山堂、西园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhidqvTa8wYx-EBZsDy4BaQE-yT2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>免费拍照点：瘦西湖北门、双峰云栈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 小盘古 拍照推荐&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 吴道台宅第 拍照推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 汪氏小苑 拍照推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">27:47</a> 免费拍照点推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIZul1vivbe5v1jGHS58VvOFCQz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>绿杨城郭是扬州，卷石洞天、西园曲水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 瘦西湖东门、扬州非遗展示区、板桥道情文化园（节目当时没记得起来）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRNhVxn0tdkP0xxu7D2j-HLzmo0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 瘦西湖北门、双峰云栈、旧茶园（图示在 大明寺 那张图） &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 宝带源</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvjI3LZ-OVXa-i7bMEASm14rrG_b.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 史可法纪念馆 拍照推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 荷花池公园 拍照推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 扬州淮扬菜博物馆、卢氏盐商住宅、意园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 唐槐、南柯一梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 扬州经典拍照地推荐，非节假日来哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于瘦西湖、个园、何园、片石山房、扬州有盐、二分明月楼、四望亭、文昌阁、扬州中国大运河博物馆、天宁寺、冶春虹桥修禊等 拍照打卡地推荐 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面图片来自网络，如有侵权，一定删除。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你评论、留言，如有需要，请微信搜索添加一下我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在扬州等你。</span></p>]]></description>
